-- Plain-language descriptions for the collection viewer. Does not collect data.
local _,ns=...
local G={topics={}};ns.CollectionGuide=G
local function Add(key,label,what,when,example,limit,where)
    G.topics[key]={key=key,label=label,what=what,when=when,example=example,limit=limit,where=where or 'Recorded Events: choose the matching event type.'}
end
Add('time','Recording and measured time','Time spent in the world while recording is active, with AFK time marked separately. Session and character IDs keep histories apart.','World entry and observed time intervals. Offline time, loading screens and long unobserved gaps are excluded.','Twenty recorded minutes can include five marked AFK minutes.','Measured time is not your account-wide /played total. Activity before opt-in cannot be recovered.','Recorded Events: Session started, Measured world time and Recording gap.')
Add('storage','History size and event counts','Estimated space used by saved records across all recorded characters. A record can contain many route samples or a whole snapshot.','Updated as history changes. Personal routes, Player Intelligence, historical player tracks and other events are counted separately.','One route record can hold sixty coordinate observations.','These are record-size estimates, not measured disk space or Lua memory. Shared gear objects are counted once under other events. Warnings never delete history.','Collection Status: select a character size entry. Backup & Restore explains full-file backups.')
Add('route','Your movement route','Your own map coordinates, native position values, zone, timestamps, and readable facing/speed.','Normally every two seconds during active recording. Identical positions are stored as runs; missing readings start gaps.','A walk from Goldshire toward Stormwind preserves the positions actually read.','No positions are invented between samples. Instances can hide coordinates; native height may be a placeholder.','Recorded Events: Travel route segment and Recording gap.')
Add('Player encounter locations','Player encounter locations','An identifiable visible player, your location at the encounter, and their coordinates when independently readable.','Once when a grouped encounter begins. Repeated target/mouseover events within the rolling two-minute encounter window do not resample movement.','Your position can be saved even when the encountered player’s exact coordinates are unavailable.','Your coordinates never substitute for theirs. Remote group rosters and public Wanted boards are not personal sightings. Other players are not continuously tracked.','Recorded Events: Player observed; select a record to see its Encounter location snapshot.')
Add('Character','Character details','Client build, class/race/body identifiers, rested XP and readable honor values.','At recording start and relevant level, rested-XP or honor updates.','A dated snapshot says which class and client build were observed.','A starting value is a baseline, not a newly earned reward.','Recorded Events: Character observed and Character details.')
Add('Player state','Activity states','Readable AFK, alive/dead/ghost, combat, mount, swimming, flight, taxi, vehicle, resting and PvP flags.','On relevant native events and periodic state checks. Unchanged states are suppressed.','A state change can show that your character became mounted.','Flags do not establish a specific activity, destination, killer or reason.','Recorded Events: Character state.')
Add('Equipment','Equipment changes','Equipped item IDs and item payloads by slot, plus readable changes.','At recording start and native equipment/inventory updates.','Slot 16 changes from one observed weapon to another.','An unreadable slot does not mean it is empty.','Recorded Events: Equipment observed and Equipment changed.')
Add('gear','Full gear snapshots','Readable states for all nineteen equipment slots, full item payloads and your own item-instance GUIDs.','Stable equipment checks and major activity checkpoints. Identical objects are reused with separate observation dates.','Two visits can refer to the same saved gear object at different times.','A later inspection is not proof of gear worn during an earlier fight.','Recorded Events: Loadout observed, Important player and Native activity; select the entry to inspect linked gear.')
Add('traits','Talents','Readable committed talent configuration/node IDs and ranks, or GUID-bound inspected selections/ranks, native export and specialization ID.','After committed configuration changes and supported manual or important-player inspections.','A snapshot preserves native talent evidence for the player and its actual observation time.','Staged changes are deferred. Partial chunks and a specialization alone do not establish a complete talent build. Readable inspected choices use only the native inspect configuration, with explicit partial coverage and a bounded read. Missing exports stay unavailable.','IntelWarden: Talents, older builds and Original evidence; Recorded Events: Loadout observed or Player inspected/Important player.')
Add('appearance','Appearance descriptors','Readable race/class/body/display identifiers and supported appearance descriptors.','With loadout checkpoints and important-player observations.','Race and body identifiers can support a later partial character reconstruction.','Portrait pixels, complete opponent face/hair and all transmog details may be unavailable.','Recorded Events: Loadout observed and Important player; inspect linked appearance data.')
Add('barber','Barber changes','Readable option and choice IDs after an applied barber change.','After native confirmation that the change was applied.','An applied choice records its native option and choice IDs.','Previewing or cancelling a choice does not become a saved appearance change.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked barber data.')
Add('equipment_set','Named equipment sets','Readable equipment-manager set definitions and equipped flags.','At recording start and equipment-set updates.','A named set definition can be preserved alongside the gear actually equipped.','A set definition is not proof that those items were worn at a particular event.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked equipment-set data.')
Add('stats','Character combat stats','Readable effective attributes, armor, maximum health/power, critical-strike chance and haste.','With supported loadout/stat updates.','A dated loadout can include the maximum health observed at that time.','These describe a state; they do not measure performance or infer buffs that were not read.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked stats.')
Add('gear_condition','Item durability','Readable current and maximum durability by equipment slot.','At supported durability/equipment updates.','A slot changes from 40/60 to 35/60 durability.','A change alone does not prove a repair purchase or its cost.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked gear-condition data.')
Add('Skills','Skills and professions','Readable skill-line IDs/names, ranks and maximum ranks, plus observed rank changes.','At recording start and native skill-line updates.','Alchemy is first observed at 30/75, then changes to 31/75.','The initial rank is not a gain. Collapsed or unavailable rows are not guessed.','Recorded Events: Skill observed and Skill changed.')
Add('progress','Level, XP and money','Observed levels, verified XP differences, native quest turn-ins, and before/after money balances.','On native level, XP, quest turn-in and money updates.','A money balance goes from 10000 to 10500 copper.','A balance change does not identify a sale, repair or reward. Unknown level thresholds are not reconstructed.','Recorded Events: Level changed, XP changed, Money changed and Quest turned in.')
Add('Quests','Quests and objectives','Native accept, turn-in and removal events, plus readable quest-log IDs and objective progress.','At start, on quest-log changes, and on native quest lifecycle events.','A quest objective is observed at three of ten required items.','Removal alone does not prove abandonment or completion.','Recorded Events: Quest accepted, Quest turned in, Quest removed from log and Quest objective observed.')
Add('Reputation','Reputation standings','Readable faction standings and supported same-faction before/after changes.','At recording start and native reputation updates.','A known faction standing changes between two observations.','Initial values are baselines. Unsupported major-faction changes do not become guessed earned reputation.','Recorded Events: Reputation observed and Native activity.')
Add('Bag inventory','Bag contents','Readable carried-bag slot item IDs, item payloads and quantities.','At recording start and supported bag updates.','A bag slot is observed containing a stack of five items.','A slot change does not prove acquisition, a trade, a sale or who received loot.','Recorded Events: Bag item observed.')
Add('Loot offered','Loot-window items','Readable item IDs and quantities shown in a native loot window.','When a supported loot window opens.','A loot window offers two items.','This is not proof that you acquired either item, who won it, or what was killed.','Recorded Events: Item offered in loot window.')
Add('Spellbook','Spellbook and learned spells','Readable spellbook entries and separate native learned-spell deliveries.','At start and supported spellbook or learned-spell events.','A new native learned-spell delivery is separate from the starting spellbook.','The starting spellbook does not establish when each spell was learned.','Recorded Events: Spellbook observed and Spell learned.')
Add('crafting','Recipes and crafting results','Readable native learned-recipe IDs and actual crafted-result item IDs, quantities and readable item payloads.','On supported NEW_RECIPE_LEARNED and TRADE_SKILL_ITEM_CRAFTED_RESULT deliveries.','An actual craft-result event records its returned item ID and quantity.','Casting a profession spell alone is not a craft result. No complete gathering, enchant or repair history is inferred.','Recorded Events: Native activity; look for recipe_learned and native_craft_result.')
Add('achievements','Achievements','Native achievement-earned IDs and readable delivery flags.','When the native achievement-earned event arrives while recording is enabled.','An achievement ID arrives with its recorded time.','The recorder does not reconstruct earlier achievement dates or scan a complete historical journal.','Recorded Events: Achievement earned.')
Add('Bind location','Hearthstone bind location','Readable bind-location names and native bind-change observations.','At recording start and native hearthstone-bound updates.','The readable inn/location name changes.','No exact bind coordinates are invented.','Recorded Events: Bind location observed.')
Add('Currencies','Currency balances','ID-bound readable currency balances, caps, weekly totals and native update payloads.','At supported currency discovery/update events.','A currency is first observed at a balance of 20; a later matching-scope balance is 25.','Starting balances are not gains. Filtered/collapsed lists can omit currencies, and account/character scope stays explicit.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect currency data.')
Add('currency','Currency snapshot objects','The dated currency data linked by currency activity records.','When a readable, ID-matched currency snapshot changes.','Two activity entries can reuse an identical currency snapshot.','An object is storage for an observation, not an additional currency award.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked currency data. Raw objects are hidden by default.')
Add('Lockouts','Instance lockouts','Readable cached saved-instance/world-boss rows, difficulty, flags and observed reset expiry.','At supported saved-instance cache updates and recording start.','A cached saved-instance row includes a difficulty and reset time.','The cache may be stale. Readable coverage does not prove personal boss kills or a completed dungeon.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect saved-instance data.')
Add('lockout_list','Saved lockout snapshot objects','Bounded parts of a readable cached lockout list.','When the observed native cache changes.','A list may be preserved in several linked parts.','Complete means readable rows in that cache, not independently confirmed attendance or completion.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked lockout-list data.')
Add('Mounts','Owned mounts','Readable owned mount IDs/spell descriptors and separate explicit new-mount events.','At supported catalog observations and native new-mount delivery.','An initial owned catalog is separate from a new-mount event.','Initial ownership does not reveal the original unlock date.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect collection data.')
Add('Pets','Owned pets','Readable owned pet GUIDs, species and basic descriptors.','At supported pet-catalog observations and new-pet deliveries.','A saved pet GUID keeps one owned pet distinct from another.','Private custom names and notes are excluded. The starting catalog is not a new unlock.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect collection data.')
Add('Toys','Owned toys','Readable owned toys in the current filtered native view and explicit new-toy deliveries.','On supported catalog and new-toy updates.','A toy appears in the currently readable owned list.','Filters are not changed. A toy missing from a filtered view is not treated as lost.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect collection data.')
Add('collection','Owned collection snapshot objects','Dated mount/pet/toy descriptors referenced by activity records.','When supported collection data is read.','A collection object can be reused by several dated observations.','The catalog date is an observation date, not a reconstructed historical unlock date.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked collection data.')
Add('Important players','Important players and companions','GUID-bound identities, relationship observations and supported detailed snapshots for companions, manually inspected players, encountered friends, bookmarks, Wanted and native kill-credit subjects.','At supported group/encounter/bookmark events and completed deliberate native inspections while recording.','A deliberate Inspect records a manual-inspection interaction; a roster establishes a teammate relationship.','Neither implies combat participation or wrongdoing. No passerby inspection sweep is added.','IntelWarden: Recently met; Recorded Events: Player inspected, Group observed, Player observed and Important player.')
Add('Inspection','Player inspection','Readable equipment, talents and appearance obtained through normal GUID-matched inspection.','For important players with an owned request, or after your native Inspect window requests the same GUID. Recording must be enabled.','A completed manual inspection attaches readable gear to that exact player as important-player evidence.','Unrelated addon requests, changed targets and stale responses are rejected. Missing slots stay unknown; gear keeps its actual observation date.','IntelWarden: Appearance & Gear; Recorded Events: Player inspected or Important player, with original gear/traits/appearance references.')
Add('event-view','Events and all recorded data','Two views of the same retained history. Events shows meaningful changes and actions; All recorded data also shows observations, routes, time spans and background summaries.','Whenever you browse Recorded Events. It starts in Events view; custom event types deliberately use All recorded data.','A boss result is visible by default while a baseline PvP counter snapshot is hidden, even though both are native activity records.','This only changes presentation. It neither changes collection/consent nor deletes records, and it does not turn uncertain results into verified facts. Custom filters stay while you use the workspace; filter preferences are not saved across logins.','Recording > Recorded Events: View and Event types.')
Add('activities','Shared activities and player history','Local views connecting existing dungeon/raid entries, group rosters, native boss attempts and original evidence references. These summaries are rebuilt; they are not saved as a second history.','When you open Activities or request a recorded player history. Work is spread across small steps and waits during combat.','A dungeon segment can show its saved roster and a reported boss failure even with no damage meter.','Roster association is not confirmed boss attendance. Exits are not completions. Reloads and recording gaps remain separate segments. Exact grouped time and matched DPS/HPS remain unavailable. No new collection or sharing is enabled.','Recording > Activities; /ocw chronicle activities; /ocw intel history for a recorded target.')
Add('group','Group and guild associations','Readable party/raid rosters, companion GUIDs and guild names observed with those identities. Permitted Olympus profile history remains separate.','When supported roster or public-profile data changes.','A dated roster lists which GUIDs were reported in your group.','This does not establish attendance at a specific boss kill, distance, or a complete guild census.','Recorded Events: Group observed, Player observed, Important player and Olympus archive.')
Add('combat','Combat, bosses and duels','Native own combat boundaries, grouped successful own spellcasts, encounter start/end results, boss-kill deliveries and duel lifecycle events.','On supported native activity events. Repeated own casts are grouped into counts.','A native encounter-end result preserves its own success field.','Cast success is not damage. A failed encounter is not automatically a wipe; a boss kill or instance exit is not whole-dungeon completion. Duel finish does not supply a guessed winner.','Recorded Events: Native activity.')
Add('Duels','Optional duel history','Separate opt-in for GUID-bound duel challenges, accepted countdowns, native participant-matched results, dated before/after gear and talent observations, and bounded successful casts/received amounts.','Only while both Chronicle recording and optional duel recording are enabled. Opponent capture uses the existing scheduler, with one priority opportunity per phase.','Ten duels remain ten sessions while unchanged equipment and talents share immutable content.','Countdown is an acceptance boundary, not exact combat start. Damage/healing received has no attacker attribution. Missing inspections stay missing; generic finish never proves a win. No raw combat log, scanning or outgoing sharing.','ChronicleWarden > Activities > Duels; IntelWarden > Shared activities; recording settings for the separate opt-in.')
Add('Native kill credit','Native kill-credit observations','Readable native actor and target GUIDs, entity type, and self/current-pet/group/unattributed credit. Supported creature GUIDs retain their NPC ID; a name and classification require a currently matching visible unit.','When a supported PARTY_KILL payload arrives.','A group actor is kept as group credit rather than being credited to you.','This is not automatically a PvP win, honorable kill or proof of last hit. Hidden victim identities are not reconstructed.','Recorded Events: Native activity; look for native_kill_credit.')
Add('PvP counters','PvP totals','Readable lifetime, session and yesterday native counters, including supported dishonorable-kill totals.','At supported PvP updates and recording start.','A lifetime honorable-kill total is observed at a certain value.','Totals do not identify victims or establish individual encounter victories.','Recorded Events: Native activity; look for pvp_counter_snapshot.')
Add('Forever rank','Forever rank progress','Readable native rank-faction values under a verified client-build mapping.','On supported rank/PvP checks.','A dated native rank-progress value is saved on a known client build.','Unknown client mappings do not receive a guessed faction or rank.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked rank data.')
Add('rank','Rank snapshot objects','Dated readable rank-faction fields referenced by rank activity.','When a supported native rank snapshot changes.','A rank activity refers to its saved native progress fields.','Source progress is not an inferred title or promotion.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked rank data.')
Add('Damage meter','Combat totals from the native meter','Supported post-combat session, source and spell aggregates with native session/reset identifiers.','Out of combat after supported meter updates.','A readable spell total is kept for its native meter session.','These are source totals, not a chronological combat log or a complete victim ledger.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked meter data.')
Add('meter','Combat meter snapshot objects','Dated native source/spell aggregates linked by combat activity records.','During supported out-of-combat meter reads.','Several activity records can refer to one unchanged saved total.','Meter amounts do not establish a pairwise damage history or a particular victim.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked meter data.')
Add('PvP scores','Battleground and match results','Readable native scoreboard rows, supported match result/duration fields and objective IDs, values and column labels when supplied. Coverage is recorded separately.','After native match completion, with at most three bounded score reads while the same instance context remains available.','Three native flag captures remain a dated value of three in that player report.','Final scoreboard freshness is unverified. A partial report is not a complete match, and repeated reports are not added together.','Recorded Events: Native activity; inspect linked scoreboard data and capture status.')
Add('Native statistics','Native character statistics','Native statistic IDs, category IDs, titles, displayed values, locale and build, with actual observation dates. Plain ASCII integers may also have an exact numeric value.','One cooperative catalog discovery per character/build/locale in a login session, then meaningful event checkpoints throttled to at most one full read every two minutes. Unchanged values are not saved again.','A displayed flag total changes from 144 to 147; Warden retains the two values without inventing three capture events.','Native character/account scope, reset rules and update latency remain unknown unless independently verified. Commas, decimals and units are never guessed. Native totals are separate from recorded opponents and activities.','All recorded data > Native activity; /warden chronicle statistics and /warden chronicle statistics ids PAGE show the discovered catalog. No Statistics window is opened.')
Add('scoreboard','Scoreboard snapshot objects','Readable native player score rows with up to twelve objective ID/value pairs, optional native column metadata and explicit completeness fields.','At supported in-progress and completion score observations.','The dated source score rows remain available for later review.','Unknown objective values stay unknown. Names and totals are not converted into independent kills or encounters; native freshness and unique match identity remain uncertain.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked scoreboard data.')
Add('recap','Death recap details','Readable native recap rows for an explicit supported recap ID.','When a supported native source supplies a recap ID and its rows can be read.','A saved recap is tied to the ID actually delivered.','A recap can be incomplete; a death event alone does not justify guessing the killer.','Recorded Events: Native activity; linked recap data.')
Add('olympus','Olympus public history','Permitted Wanted, own public profile and supported community ranking snapshots, with dates and changes.','When supported Olympus API data becomes available or changes, with permission.','A dated Wanted board preserves its listed GUIDs and bounty values.','A public listing is source information, not proof you encountered that player. Private Olympus internals are excluded.','Recorded Events: Olympus archive. Show raw Olympus parts to inspect individual stored parts.')
Add('Enrichment queue','Detail work queue','Status of pending supported detail work, such as a snapshot or inspection follow-up.','When the bounded per-frame work queue reaches its budget or a task fails.','An original native activity can remain saved while extra detail is unavailable.','Known queue failures are aggregated into dated recording gaps; they are not gameplay activities.','Recorded Events: the original activity; missing detail is not inferred.')
Add('preservation','Retention and backup','All valid saved history, including historical other-player tracks and personal notes.','Kept until you explicitly clear it. WoW saves addon data on orderly reload/logout.','A complete SavedVariables backup can carry all recorded characters to a new PC.','Crashes can lose unsaved changes. Backups belong outside the addon folder; no automatic upload, expiry or external archive is added.','Recording > Backup & Restore. Use the optional Windows tool for one complete backup ZIP.')
Add('rewards','Structured reward deliveries','Native quest item/currency reward deliveries and encounter loot payloads, with original item strings, quantities and source IDs.','Only when the corresponding supported native event delivers readable fields.','A quest reward can remain in history even if you immediately sell the item.','Encounter loot has no recipient GUID in the pinned payload: it is explicitly recipient unknown. Quest reward delivery does not prove which option you selected. General bag differences are not acquisitions.','Recorded Events: quest reward deliveries and encounter loot delivery.')
Add('Boss status','Boss status at encounter end','Readable native boss creature IDs, names and remaining health percentages from the encounter-end payload.','Synchronously at encounter end; up to forty boss entries.','A failed attempt can retain native remaining health without estimating your damage.','Absent, restricted, malformed or excessive fields remain partial; no later target is substituted. Live delivery varies.','Recorded Events: boss encounter ended; All recorded data: linked boss health rows.')
Add('coverage','Known recording gaps','Compact dated summaries of known detail failures, unavailable score readers, partial boss/objective fields and queue saturation.','Aggregated over thirty seconds or flushed at recording boundaries.','An encounter remains recorded while a missing boss-status field is explained separately.','No gaps reported does not prove complete recording. Paused or unconsented periods are not secretly monitored.','Recorded Events: Recording gap.')
function G.Describe(row)
    local info=row.info or G.topics[row.key]
    if not info then info={label=row.label or row.key,what='A collector reported the status shown below. This release has no separate data description for this diagnostic key.',when='When the named collector reports a status.',example='No additional observations are inferred from this diagnostic.',limit='A status message does not establish that every field was recorded.',where='Recorded Events: inspect the original source and saved details.'} end
    local help=info.what..' '..info.limit
    local out={}
    local function Block(kind,text) out[#out+1]={kind=kind,text=text,tooltipTitle=info.label,tooltip=help} end
    Block('title',info.label)
    Block('heading','What is saved');Block('body',info.what)
    Block('heading','When it records');Block('body',info.when)
    Block('heading','Illustrative example');Block('body',info.example)
    Block('heading','Limits');Block('body',info.limit)
    Block('heading','Where to find it');Block('body',info.where)
    if row.status then Block('heading','Collector report for this addon session');Block('body',row.status) end
    if row.metrics then Block('heading','Saved history and counters');Block('body',row.metrics) end
    if row.methods then Block('heading','Client API availability');Block('body',row.methods) end
    return out
end
